            "v": "graduated",
            "ref": "v-graduate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with a master’s degree in English Education from Sunshine University in 2017."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Welcome to the sixth grade!"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I am pleased to welcome you to the 2026-2027 school year! You will learn a lot of new knowledge this year. As a student, your job is to learn, think, ask questions and make mistakes. My goal is to help you develop a love for learning. I will also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "focus on",
            "ref": "v-focus-on"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " teaching life skills in my class. I am "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "looking forward to",
            "ref": "v-look-forward-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a wonderful school year with all of you!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h4",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Contact me"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Please feel free to contact me at any time with questions."
          }
        ]
      },
